@arity    3
@match    (finite, finite, finite)
@summary  emit control event with 3 arguments
@doc
Emits control event with 2 parameters.
Usage: ce id p1 p2
@code
    opcode_event_t op = { .code = SKODE_OP_CONTROL_EVENT, .argc = 3 };
    op.arg[0] = args[0];
